  "contract": "【逻辑】\n你在生成一个「Frost 社交状态栏」。必须严格按照下方字段顺序、数量与格式输出，任何一条不满足都视为无效输出。\n\n1. 必须完整输出 4 个区，顺序固定：Frost、Trending、Nearby、Me；区标题行原样保留（# Frost 区 / # Trending 区 / # Nearby 区 / # Me 区）。\n2. 每个区必须正好 3 条主贴，ID 固定为 f1-f3、t1-t3、n1-n3、m1-m3；禁止少写、合并、只写 1-2 条、跳号。\n3. 每条主贴必须带 2-3 条评论，评论 ID 从 _c1 连续编号；禁止缺评论、跳号。\n4. 字段之间只用半角竖线 | 分隔，字段内禁止出现 |；标签用英文逗号 , 分隔，每个标签以 # 开头。\n5. 没有内容的字段必须写“无”，禁止留空、写 null、写“暂无”。\n6. 字段数量固定：f 主贴 8 字段；t 主贴 9 字段（多 hotScore）；n 主贴 9 字段（多 distance）；m 主贴 7 字段；评论固定 3 字段。\n7. gradient 与 caption 必须成对：要么都写，要么都写“无”；gradient 必须是合法 CSS，如 linear-gradient(135deg, #1e3a8a, #7ab8ff)。\n8. Frost 为普通动态，time 用“X分钟前/X小时前”，likes 为 10-500；Trending 必须带 hotScore（0-100 整数），likes 为 1000+，按 hotScore 从高到低；Nearby 必须带 distance（如 0.3km），按距离从近到远；Me 的 time 用“昨天/3天前/1周前”，内容为第一人称。\n9. 【ID 格式绝对约束】所有用户网名（包含主贴作者和评论者）**必须是符合社交平台风格的网名，且必须至少包含英文字母或数字**（例如：Aurora_92、CodeFrost、NightOwl_S、用户7788）。**绝对禁止**出现真实中文姓名（如张三、李华、陈敬忧、王小明），**绝对禁止**使用中文身份指代（如网友1、路人甲、我朋友、某人、匿名用户）。如果发现名字里纯是中文且像真名，立刻重写为网名。\n10. 【回复格式硬约束】如果一条评论是在回复上面某条评论（楼中楼），必须在评论正文开头加上“回复@对方ID：”。例如：`回复@NightWalker_11：我也这么觉得`。\n11. 【帖主标签绝对约束】只有**该条主贴的作者本人**回复评论时，user 前面**必须且只能**加 `*`。漏写 `*` 视为无效输出。普通人互相回复，绝对不能加 `*`。`*` 后面的名字必须和该主贴的 user 名字一模一样。\n12. me 字段必须 6 行齐全：me_name、me_id、me_bio、me_posts、me_followers、me_following。\n13. 只输出 [状态栏] 到 [/状态栏] 之间的内容，禁止解释、禁止代码块、禁止 markdown 表格。\n14. 【格式】区仅为字段结构示例，所有文本必须根据当前剧情与人设全新生成；禁止照抄示例中的任何用户名、正文、评论、标签、数字、渐变值。示例里的尖括号只是占位说明，输出时不要保留尖括号。\n\n【格式】\n[状态栏]\nme_name=<你的网名昵称，须含英文字母/数字>\nme_id=<你的账号ID，如 Echo_07x>\nme_bio=<一句简介，可用｜分隔两段>\nme_posts=<数字>\nme_followers=<数字>\nme_following=<数字>\n\n# Frost 区\nf1=<主贴作者网名，须含英文字母/数字>|<X分钟前>|<正文>|<linear-gradient(135deg, #色值1, #色值2) 或 无>|<配图描述 或 无>|<#标签1,#标签2>|<likes数字>|<comments数字>\nf1_c1=<路人网名，须含英文字母/数字>|<X分钟前>|<评论正文>\nf1_c2=<*主贴作者网名（注意：必须有星号*且名字与f1完全一致）>|<X秒前>|<回复@路人网名：帖主回复内容>\nf1_c3=<路人网名，须含英文字母/数字>|<X秒前>|<回复@路人网名：评论正文>\nf2=<主贴作者网名，须含英文字母/数字>|<X分钟前>|<正文>|<gradient 或 无>|<配图描述 或 无>|<#标签1,#标签2>|<likes数字>|<comments数字>\nf2_c1=<路人网名，须含英文字母/数字>|<X分钟前>|<评论正文>\nf2_c2=<路人网名，须含英文字母/数字>|<X秒前>|<评论正文>\nf3=<主贴作者网名，须含英文字母/数字>|<X分钟前>|<正文>|<gradient 或 无>|<配图描述 或 无>|<#标签1,#标签2>|<likes数字>|<comments数字>\nf3_c1=<路人网名，须含英文字母/数字>|<X分钟前>|<评论正文>\nf3_c2=<路人网名，须含英文字母/数字>|<X秒前>|<评论正文>\nf3_c3=<路人网名，须含英文字母/数字>|<X秒前>|<评论正文>\n\n# Trending 区\nt1=<主贴作者网名，须含英文字母/数字>|<X小时前>|<正文>|<gradient 或 无>|<配图描述 或 无>|<#标签1,#标签2>|<likes数字>|<hotScore数字>|<comments数字>\nt1_c1=<路人网名，须含英文字母/数字>|<X小时前>|<评论正文>\nt1_c2=<*主贴作者网名（注意：必须有星号*且名字与t1完全一致）>|<X小时前>|<回复@路人网名：帖主回复内容>\nt1_c3=<路人网名，须含英文字母/数字>|<X分钟前>|<回复@路人网名：评论正文>\nt2=<主贴作者网名，须含英文字母/数字>|<X小时前>|<正文>|<gradient 或 无>|<配图描述 或 无>|<#标签1,#标签2>|<likes数字>|<hotScore数字>|<comments数字>\nt2_c1=<路人网名，须含英文字母/数字>|<X小时前>|<评论正文>\nt2_c2=<路人网名，须含英文字母/数字>|<X分钟前>|<评论正文>\nt3=<主贴作者网名，须含英文字母/数字>|<X小时前>|<正文>|<gradient 或 无>|<配图描述 或 无>|<#标签1,#标签2>|<likes数字>|<hotScore数字>|<comments数字>\nt3_c1=<路人网名，须含英文字母/数字>|<X小时前>|<评论正文>\nt3_c2=<路人网名，须含英文字母/数字>|<X分钟前>|<评论正文>\nt3_c3=<路人网名，须含英文字母/数字>|<X分钟前>|<评论正文>\n\n# Nearby 区\nn1=<主贴作者网名，须含英文字母/数字>|<X.Xkm>|<刚刚/X分钟前>|<正文>|<gradient 或 无>|<配图描述 或 无>|<#标签1,#标签2>|<likes数字>|<comments数字>\nn1_c1=<路人网名，须含英文字母/数字>|<刚刚/X秒前>|<评论正文>\nn1_c2=<*主贴作者网名（注意：必须有星号*且名字与n1完全一致）>|<X秒前>|<回复@路人网名：帖主回复内容>\nn2=<主贴作者网名，须含英文字母/数字>|<X.Xkm>|<X分钟前>|<正文>|<gradient 或 无>|<配图描述 或 无>|<#标签1,#标签2>|<likes数字>|<comments数字>\nn2_c1=<路人网名，须含英文字母/数字>|<X分钟前>|<评论正文>\nn2_c2=<路人网名，须含英文字母/数字>|<X分钟前>|<评论正文>\nn3=<主贴作者网名，须含英文字母/数字>|<X.Xkm>|<X分钟前>|<正文>|<gradient 或 无>|<配图描述 或 无>|<#标签1,#标签2>|<likes数字>|<comments数字>\nn3_c1=<路人网名，须含英文字母/数字>|<X分钟前>|<评论正文>\nn3_c2=<路人网名，须含英文字母/数字>|<X分钟前>|<评论正文>\n\n# Me 区\nm1=<昨天/3天前/1周前>|<正文>|<gradient 或 无>|<配图描述 或 无>|<#标签1,#标签2>|<likes数字>|<comments数字>\nm1_c1=<路人网名，须含英文字母/数字>|<X小时前>|<评论正文>\nm1_c2=<*你的账号ID（注意：必须有星号*且名字与me_id完全一致）>|<X小时前>|<回复@路人网名：帖主回复内容>\nm1_c3=<路人网名，须含英文字母/数字>|<X小时前>|<回复@路人网名：评论正文>\nm2=<昨天/3天前/1周前>|<正文>|<gradient 或 无>|<配图描述 或 无>|<#标签1,#标签2>|<likes数字>|<comments数字>\nm2_c1=<路人网名，须含英文字母/数字>|<X天前>|<评论正文>\nm2_c2=<路人网名，须含英文字母/数字>|<X天前>|<评论正文>\nm3=<昨天/3天前/1周前>|<正文>|<gradient 或 无>|<配图描述 或 无>|<#标签1,#标签2>|<likes数字>|<comments数字>\nm3_c1=<路人网名，须含英文字母/数字>|<X天前>|<评论正文>\nm3_c2=<路人网名，须含英文字母/或数字>|<X天前>|<评论正文>\nm3_c3=<路人网名，须含英文字母/数字>|<X天前>|<评论正文>\n[/状态栏]",
  "renderHtml": "<style>\n* { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; }\nhtml, body { background: transparent; overflow: hidden; }\nbody { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; justify-content: center; padding: 8px; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; }\n\n.app {\n  position: relative;\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 360px;\n  height: 560px;\n  min-height: 560px;\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  background: #000;\n  border-radius: 14px;\n  border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);\n  overflow: hidden;\n  color: #fff;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n}\n\n/* 夜间下雪动画 */\n.snow-container {\n  position: absolute;\n  top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;\n  pointer-events: none;\n  z-index: 0;\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n.snowflake {\n  position: absolute;\n  top: -10px;\n  background-color: #ffffff;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  animation-name: fall;\n  animation-timing-function: linear;\n  animation-iteration-count: infinite;\n  filter: blur(1px);\n}\n@keyframes fall {\n  0% { transform: translateY(-10px); }\n  100% { transform: translateY(560px); }\n}\n\n.status-bar {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  align-items: center;\n  padding: 11px 15px;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);\n  background: #000;\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n  position: relative;\n  z-index: 1;\n}\n.status-bar .title { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1px; }\n.status-bar .title span { color: #6ec6ff; }\n\n.btn-back-profile{\n  font-size:12px;\n  color:rgba(255,255,255,0.45);\n  background:none;\n  border:none;\n}\n.btn-back-profile:active{\n  color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);\n}\n\n.tabs { display: flex; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); background: #000; flex-shrink: 0; position: relative; z-index: 1; }\n.tabs .tab { flex: 1; text-align: center; padding: 10px 0; font-size: 12px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4); cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.3s; position: relative; }\n.tabs .tab.active { color: #fff; }\n.tabs .tab.active::after { content: ''; position: absolute; bottom: 0; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); width: 20px; height: 2px; background: #6ec6ff; border-radius: 1px; }\n\n.feed {\n  flex: 1;\n  min-height: 0;\n  overflow-y: auto;\n  -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;\n  background: transparent;\n  position: relative;\n  z-index: 1;\n}\n.feed.me-feed-center{\n  display:flex;\n  align-items:center;\n  justify-content:center;\n}\n.feed::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }\n\n/* Me个人资料卡片 —— 去掉光晕、卡片，头像放大 */\n.me-profile {\n  padding: 20px 16px;\n  text-align: center;\n  border-bottom:none;\n}\n.me-avatar {\n  width: 60px; height: 60px;\n  border-radius: 50%; background: #1f1f1f;\n  margin: 0 auto 10px; overflow: hidden;\n  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\n  box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.08);\n}\n.me-avatar svg { width: 110%; height: 110%; transform: translateY(2px); }\n.me-avatar svg .head { fill: #b5b5b5; }\n.me-avatar svg .shoulders { fill: #b5b5b5; }\n\n.me-name { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; }\n.me-account-id {\n  font-size:12px;\n  color:rgba(255,255,255,0.45);\n  margin-top:3px;\n}\n.me-bio {\n  font-size: 12px;\n  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5);\n  margin-top: 7px;\n  line-height: 1.4;\n  padding: 0 10px;\n  display: -webkit-box;\n  -webkit-line-clamp: 2;\n  -webkit-box-orient: vertical;\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n.me-stats {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: center;\n  gap: 36px;\n  margin-top: 17px;\n}\n.me-stat {\n  text-align: center;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  flex:0 0 auto;\n}\n.me-stat-num { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; }\n.me-stat-label { font-size: 10px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4); margin-top:3px; }\n\n/* 查看历史动态按钮 —— 实心，无按下动画 */\n.btn-history-posts{\n  margin-top:17px;\n  padding:8px 19px;\n  border:none;\n  background:#6ec6ff;\n  color:#000000;\n  border-radius:20px;\n  font-size:12px;\n  font-weight:600;\n  transition: none;\n}\n.btn-history-posts:active{\n  transform: none;\n}\n\n.me-section-title {\n  padding: 9px 14px;\n  font-size: 10px;\n  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4);\n  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);\n}\n\n.post { padding: 12px 14px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06); }\n.post-header { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; margin-bottom: 9px; }\n.avatar { width: 34px; height: 34px; border-radius: 50%; background: #1f1f1f; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.05); }\n.avatar svg { width: 110%; height: 110%; transform: translateY(2px); display: block; }\n.avatar svg .head { fill: #b5b5b5; }\n.avatar svg .shoulders { fill: #b5b5b5; }\n\n.rank-badge { width: 22px; height: 22px; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; }\n.rank-1 { background: linear-gradient(135deg,#ffd700,#ffaa00); color: #000; }\n.rank-2 { background: linear-gradient(135deg,#c0c0c0,#a0a0a0); color: #000; }\n.rank-3 { background: linear-gradient(135deg,#cd7f32,#a0522d); color: #fff; }\n.rank-normal { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5); }\n\n.distance { font-size: 10px; color: #6ec6ff; background: rgba(110,198,255,0.1); padding: 2px 5px; border-radius: 7px; }\n\n.post-meta { flex: 1; overflow: hidden; }\n.post-meta .name { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; max-width: 160px; }\n.post-meta .sub { font-size: 10px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.35); margin-top: 2px; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; }\n\n.post-content { font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.9); margin-bottom: 9px; word-break: break-all; }\n\n.post-image-text {\n  font-size: 14px;\n  color: #ffffff !important;\n  font-weight: 700 !important;\n  font-style: normal !important;\n  text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(255,255,255,0.6), 0 0 16px rgba(255,255,255,0.3) !important;\n  margin-bottom: 9px;\n  line-height: 1.5;\n  word-break: break-all;\n}\n\n.post-tags { display: flex; gap: 5px; margin-bottom: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; }\n.post-tags .tag { font-size: 11px; color: #6ec6ff; background: rgba(110,198,255,0.1); padding: 3px 7px; border-radius: 9px; }\n\n.post-actions { display: flex; gap: 17px; align-items: center; }\n.action { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px; font-size: 12px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5); cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s; user-select: none; }\n.action .icon { font-size: 14px; transition: transform 0.2s; }\n.action:active .icon { transform: scale(1.3); }\n.action.liked { color: #ff5252; }\n.action.liked .icon { animation: heartPop 0.3s ease; }\n@keyframes heartPop { 0% { transform: scale(1); } 50% { transform: scale(1.4); } 100% { transform: scale(1); } }\n\n.comments { margin-top: 10px; padding-top: 10px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06); display: none; position: relative; overflow: hidden; }\n.comments.open { display: block; }\n.comments.open .comment { opacity: 0; animation: danmuFloat 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1) forwards; }\n@keyframes danmuFloat { 0% { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(50px) scale(0.92); } 60% { opacity: 1; } 100% { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0) scale(1); } }\n.comment { display: flex; gap: 7px; margin-bottom: 9px; }\n.comment:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }\n.comment-avatar { width: 24px; height: 24px; border-radius: 50%; background: #2a2a2a; flex-shrink: 0; overflow: hidden; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }\n.comment-avatar svg { width: 110%; height: 110%; }\n.comment-avatar svg .head { fill: #8a8a8a; }\n.comment-avatar svg .shoulders { fill: #8a8a8a; }\n.comment-body { flex:1; }\n.comment-name-row { display:flex; gap:5px; align-items:center; }\n.comment-body .comment-name { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); }\n.comment-owner-badge { font-size:9px; padding:1px 4px; border-radius:4px; background:rgba(110,198,255,0.18); color:#6ec6ff; }\n.comment-body .comment-text { font-size: 12px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7); line-height:1.4; margin-top:1px; word-break: break-all; }\n.comment-body .comment-time { font-size:9px; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.3); margin-top:2px; }\n.comment-empty { font-size:12px; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.4); text-align:center; padding:10px 0; }\n\n.trending-bar { height:3px; background:rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius:2px; margin-top:9px; overflow:hidden; }\n.trending-fill { height:100%; border-radius:2px; transition:width 0.5s; background:linear-gradient(90deg,#555,#888); }\n\n.empty-state { display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:center; padding:50px 16px; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.3); text-align:center; }\n.empty-state .empty-icon { font-size:42px; margin-bottom:10px; }\n.empty-state .empty-text { font-size:13px; }\n\n/* 底部导航，无按压动画 */\n.bottom-nav { display:flex; border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); background:#000; flex-shrink:0; position: relative; z-index: 1; }\n.bottom-nav .nav-item {\n  flex:1;\n  display:flex;\n  flex-direction:column;\n  align-items:center;\n  justify-content:center;\n  gap:3px;\n  padding:8px 0 12px;\n  cursor:pointer;\n  color:rgba(255,255,255,0.35);\n  position:relative;\n}\n.bottom-nav .nav-item.active { color:#6ec6ff; }\n.bottom-nav .nav-item.active::before { content:''; position:absolute; top:0; left:50%; transform:translateX(-50%); width:28px; height:2px; background:#6ec6ff; border-radius:0 0 2px 2px; }\n.bottom-nav .nav-icon { font-size:21px; }\n.bottom-nav .nav-label { font-size:10px; font-weight:500; }\n\n.toast { position:absolute; top:52px; left:50%; transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(-20px); background:rgba(110,198,255,0.15); border:1px solid rgba(110,198,255,0.4); color:#fff; padding:7px 14px; border-radius:18px; font-size:11px; opacity:0; transition:all 0.3s; z-index:200; pointer-events:none; }\n.toast.show { opacity:1; transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(0); }\n\n/* 浅色模式 */\n@media (prefers-color-scheme: light) {\n  .snow-container { display: none; }\n  .feed { background: #ffffff; }\n  .app { background: #ffffff; border-color: rgba(0,0,0,0.08); color: #111111; }\n  .status-bar { background:#ffffff; border-bottom-color:rgba(0,0,0,0.08); }\n  .btn-back-profile{ color:rgba(0,0,0,0.45); }\n  .btn-back-profile:active{ color:rgba(0,0,0,0.7); }\n  .tabs { background:#ffffff; border-bottom-color:rgba(0,0,0,0.08); }\n  .tabs .tab { color:rgba(0,0,0,0.4); }\n  .tabs .tab.active { color:#111111; }\n  .me-profile { border-bottom:none; }\n  .me-avatar { background:#f2f2f2; box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); }\n  .me-avatar svg .head,.me-avatar svg .shoulders { fill:#555555; }\n  .me-name { color:#111111; }\n  .me-account-id { color:rgba(0,0,0,0.45); }\n  .me-bio { color:rgba(0,0,0,0.5); }\n  .me-stat-num { color:#111111; }\n  .me-stat-label { color:rgba(0,0,0,0.4); }\n  .me-section-title { color:rgba(0,0,0,0.4); border-bottom-color:rgba(0,0,0,0.06); }\n  .btn-history-posts{ background:#6ec6ff; color:#ffffff; }\n  .post { border-bottom-color:rgba(0,0,0,0.06); }\n  .avatar { background:#f2f2f2; box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); }\n  .avatar svg .head,.avatar svg .shoulders { fill:#555555; }\n  .rank-normal { background:rgba(0,0,0,0.08); color:rgba(0,0,0,0.5); }\n  .post-meta .name { color:#111111; }\n  .post-meta .sub { color:rgba(0,0,0,0.35); }\n  .post-content { color:rgba(0,0,0,0.88); }\n  .post-image-text {\n    color: #ffffff !important;\n    text-shadow: 0 0 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.9), 0 0 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.7), 1px 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,1) !important;\n  }\n  .action { color:rgba(0,0,0,0.45); }\n  .action .count { color:#111111; font-weight:500; }\n  .comments { border-top-color:rgba(0,0,0,0.06); }\n  .comment-avatar { background:#f2f2f2; }\n  .comment-avatar svg .head,.comment-avatar svg .shoulders { fill:#555555; }\n  .comment-body .comment-name { color:rgba(0,0,0,0.88); }\n  .comment-owner-badge { background:rgba(110,198,255,0.22); color:#0077bb; }\n  .comment-body .comment-text { color:rgba(0,0,0,0.72); }\n  .comment-body .comment-time { color:rgba(0,0,0,0.35); }\n  .comment-empty { color:rgba(0,0,0,0.4); }\n  .trending-bar { background:#e5e5e5; }\n  .trending-fill { background:linear-gradient(90deg,#bbbbbb,#dddddd); }\n  .empty-state { color:rgba(0,0,0,0.35); }\n  .bottom-nav { background:#ffffff; border-top-color:rgba(0,0,0,0.08); }\n  .bottom-nav .nav-item { color:rgba(0,0,0,0.4); }\n  .bottom-nav .nav-item.active { color:#6ec6ff; }\n  .toast { background:rgba(110,198,255,0.16); border-color:rgba(110,198,255,0.45); color:#111111; }\n}\n</style>\n<div class='app'>\n  <div class='snow-container' id='snow-container'></div>\n\n  <div class='status-bar'>\n    <div class='title'>FROST<span>·</span></div>\n    <button id=\"backProfileBtn\" class=\"btn-back-profile\" style=\"display:none;\" onclick=\"backToMe()\">返回个人主页</button>\n  </div>\n  <div class='tabs' id='tabs-slot'>\n    <div class='tab active' data-tab='frost' onclick='switchTab(this)'>Frost</div>\n    <div class='tab' data-tab='trending' onclick='switchTab(this)'>Trending</div>\n    <div class='tab' data-tab='nearby' onclick='switchTab(this)'>Nearby</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class='feed' id='feed'></div>\n  <div class='bottom-nav'>\n    <div class='nav-item active' data-page='home' onclick='switchPage(this)'><span class='nav-icon'>🏠</span><span class='nav-label'>Home</span></div>\n    <div class='nav-item' data-page='me' onclick='switchPage(this)'><span class='nav-icon'>👤</span><span class='nav-label'>Me</span></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class='toast' id='toast'></div>\n</div>\n<script>\nvar raw = window.STATUS_RAW || '';\nraw = raw.replace(/^\\[状态栏\\]/,'').replace(/\\[\\/状态栏\\]$/,'').trim();\n\nvar me = {}, rawPosts = {};\nraw.split('\\n').forEach(function(line){\n  line = line.trim();\n  if(!line || line.startsWith('#')) return;\n  var eq = line.indexOf('=');\n  if(eq === -1) return;\n  var key = line.substring(0, eq).trim();\n  var val = line.substring(eq + 1).trim();\n  if (key.match(/^[ftnm]\\d+(_c\\d+)?$/)) {\n    if (!rawPosts[key]) rawPosts[key] = [];\n    rawPosts[key].push(val);\n  } else {\n    me[key] = val;\n  }\n});\n\nvar state = {\n  totalLikes: 0,\n  currentPage: 'home',\n  currentTab: 'frost',\n  me: {\n    name: (me.me_name || ''),\n    id: (me.me_id || me.me_name || ''),\n    bio: (me.me_bio || '').split('｜').join('<br>'),\n    posts: Math.max(0, Number(me.me_posts) || 0),\n    followers: Math.max(0, Number(me.me_followers) || 0),\n    following: Math.max(0, Number(me.me_following) || 0)\n  },\n  posts: { frost: [], trending: [], nearby: [], mine: [] }\n};\n\nfunction backToMe(){\n  state.currentPage = 'me';\n  const tabsSlot = document.getElementById('tabs-slot');\n  tabsSlot.style.display='none';\n  renderPosts();\n  document.getElementById('feed').scrollTop = 0;\n}\n\nfunction parseTagString(str){\n  if(!str || str === '无') return [];\n  return str.split(',').map(s=>s.trim()).filter(s=>s.length>0);\n}\n\nfunction buildPosts(type, startId) {\n  var list = [];\n  for(var key in rawPosts) {\n    var match = key.match(new RegExp('^' + type + '(\\\\d+)$'));\n    if(match) {\n      var parts = rawPosts[key][0].split('|').map(s=>s.trim());\n      var p = { id: startId + parseInt(match[1]), comments: [], tags: [], image: null };\n      if (type === 'm') {\n        p.time = parts[0] || '';\n        p.content = parts[1] || '';\n        p.gradStr = parts[2] || '无';\n        p.captionStr = parts[3] || '无';\n        p.tags = parseTagString(parts[4]);\n        p.likes = Math.max(0, Number(parts[5])||0);\n        p.displayComments = Math.max(0, Number(parts[6])||0);\n      } else {\n        p.user = parts[0] || '';\n        if (type === 'n') {\n          p.distance = parts[1] || '';\n          p.time = parts[2] || '';\n          p.content = parts[3] || '';\n          p.gradStr = parts[4] || '无';\n          p.captionStr = parts[5] || '无';\n          p.tags = parseTagString(parts[6]);\n          p.likes = Math.max(0, Number(parts[7])||0);\n          p.displayComments = Math.max(0, Number(parts[8])||0);\n        } else if (type === 't') {\n          p.time = parts[1] || '';\n          p.content = parts[2] || '';\n          p.gradStr = parts[3] || '无';\n          p.captionStr = parts[4] || '无';\n          p.tags = parseTagString(parts[5]);\n          p.likes = Math.max(0, Number(parts[6])||0);\n          p.hotScore = Math.min(100, Math.max(0, Number(parts[7])||0));\n          p.displayComments = Math.max(0, Number(parts[8])||0);\n        } else {\n          p.time = parts[1] || '';\n          p.content = parts[2] || '';\n          p.gradStr = parts[3] || '无';\n          p.captionStr = parts[4] || '无';\n          p.tags = parseTagString(parts[5]);\n          p.likes = Math.max(0, Number(parts[6])||0);\n          p.displayComments = Math.max(0, Number(parts[7])||0);\n        }\n      }\n      if(p.captionStr && p.captionStr !== '无'){\n        p.image = { caption: p.captionStr };\n      }\n      list.push(p);\n    }\n  }\n  list.sort((a,b)=>a.id - b.id);\n  for(var key in rawPosts) {\n    var match = key.match(new RegExp('^' + type + '(\\\\d+)_c(\\\\d+)$'));\n    if(match) {\n      var postId = startId + parseInt(match[1]);\n      var post = list.find(x=>x.id === postId);\n      if(post) {\n        var cData = rawPosts[key][0].split('|').map(s=>s.trim());\n        var rawUser = cData[0]||'';\n        var isOwnerReply = false;\n        var finalUser = rawUser;\n        if(rawUser.startsWith('*')){\n          isOwnerReply = true;\n          finalUser = rawUser.substring(1);\n        }\n        post.comments.push({\n          user: finalUser,\n          isOwnerReply: isOwnerReply,\n          time: (cData[1]||''),\n          text: (cData[2]||'')\n        });\n      }\n    }\n  }\n  return list;\n}\n\nstate.posts.frost = buildPosts('f',0);\nstate.posts.trending = buildPosts('t',100);\nstate.posts.nearby = buildPosts('n',200);\nstate.posts.mine = buildPosts('m',300);\n\nfunction defaultAvatarSVG(){\n  return \"<svg viewBox='0 0 24 24' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'><circle class='head' cx='12' cy='8.2' r='4.2' /><path class='shoulders' d='M2.5 21c0-4.8 4.2-7.5 9.5-7.5s9.5 2.7 9.5 7.5v1.5H2.5z' /></svg>\";\n}\n\nfunction renderMeProfile(){\n  return \"<div class='me-profile'>\"+\n    \"<div class='me-avatar'>\"+defaultAvatarSVG()+\"</div>\"+\n    \"<div class='me-name'>\"+state.me.name+\"</div>\"+\n    \"<div class='me-account-id'>@\"+state.me.id+\"</div>\"+\n    \"<div class='me-bio'>\"+state.me.bio+\"</div>\"+\n    \"<div class='me-stats'>\"+\n      \"<div class='me-stat' onclick=\\\"handleClick(this)\\\" data-toast='\"+state.me.posts+\" 条动态'><div class='me-stat-num'>\"+state.me.posts+\"</div><div class='me-stat-label'>Posts</div></div>\"+\n      \"<div class='me-stat' onclick=\\\"handleClick(this)\\\" data-toast='\"+state.me.followers+\" 个关注者'><div class='me-stat-num'>\"+state.me.followers+\"</div><div class='me-stat-label'>Followers</div></div>\"+\n      \"<div class='me-stat' onclick=\\\"handleClick(this)\\\" data-toast='关注了 \"+state.me.following+\" 人'><div class='me-stat-num'>\"+state.me.following+\"</div><div class='me-stat-label'>Following</div></div>\"+\n    \"</div>\"+\n    \"<button class='btn-history-posts' onclick=\\\"goHistoryPosts()\\\">查看历史动态</button>\"+\n  \"</div>\";\n}\n\nfunction goHistoryPosts(){\n  state.currentPage = 'historyposts';\n  var tabsSlot = document.getElementById('tabs-slot');\n  tabsSlot.style.display='none';\n  document.getElementById('backProfileBtn').style.display='block';\n  var feedDom = document.getElementById('feed');\n  feedDom.classList.remove('me-feed-center');\n  renderPosts();\n  feedDom.scrollTop = 0;\n}\n\nfunction renderImage(img){\n  if(!img || !img.caption) return '';\n  return \"<div class='post-image-text'>「配图：\" + img.caption + \"」</div>\";\n}\n\nfunction renderComments(post){\n  if(post.comments.length === 0){\n    return \"<div class='comments' id='comments-\"+post.id+\"'><div class='comment-empty'>暂时还没有评论</div></div>\";\n  }\n  var html = post.comments.map(function(c, idx){\n    var delay = (idx*0.35).toFixed(2);\n    var badgeHtml = c.isOwnerReply ? \"<span class='comment-owner-badge'>帖主</span>\" : \"\";\n    return \"<div class='comment' style='animation-delay:\"+delay+\"s;'>\" +\n      \"<div class='comment-avatar'>\"+defaultAvatarSVG()+\"</div>\" +\n      \"<div class='comment-body'>\" +\n        \"<div class='comment-name-row'><span class='comment-name'>@\"+c.user+\"</span>\"+badgeHtml+\"</div>\" +\n        \"<div class='comment-text'>\"+c.text+\"</div>\" +\n        \"<div class='comment-time'>\"+(c.time||'')+\"</div>\" +\n      \"</div></div>\";\n  }).join('');\n  return \"<div class='comments' id='comments-\"+post.id+\"'>\"+html+\"</div>\";\n}\n\nfunction renderPosts(){\n  var feed = document.getElementById('feed');\n  var list;\n  var html = '';\n  feed.classList.remove('me-feed-center');\n  const backBtn = document.getElementById('backProfileBtn');\n  if(state.currentPage === 'historyposts'){\n    backBtn.style.display='block';\n  }else{\n    backBtn.style.display='none';\n  }\n\n  if(state.currentPage === 'me'){\n    feed.classList.add('me-feed-center');\n    html += renderMeProfile();\n  }else if(state.currentPage === 'historyposts'){\n    list = state.posts.mine;\n    html += \"<div class='me-section-title'>全部历史动态</div>\";\n  }else{\n    list = state.posts[state.currentTab] || [];\n  }\n\n  if(state.currentPage !== 'me'){\n    if(list.length === 0){\n      html += \"<div class='empty-state'><div class='empty-icon'>🌨️</div><div class='empty-text'>这里什么都没有</div></div>\";\n    }else{\n      html += list.map(function(post){\n        var headerExtra = '';\n        if(state.currentTab === 'trending'){\n          var idx = list.indexOf(post)+1;\n          headerExtra = \"<div class='rank-badge \"+(idx<=3?'rank-'+idx:'rank-normal')+\"'>\"+idx+\"</div>\";\n        }\n        var subContent = '';\n        if(state.currentTab === 'nearby'){\n          subContent = \"<span class='distance'>📍 \"+post.distance+\"</span> <span>\"+(post.time||'')+\"</span>\";\n        }else if(state.currentTab === 'trending'){\n          subContent = (post.time||'')+\" · 🔥 \"+post.hotScore+\" 热度\";\n        }else if(state.currentPage === 'historyposts'){\n          subContent = post.time||'';\n        }else{\n          subContent = post.time||'';\n        }\n        var trendingBar = state.currentTab === 'trending'\n          ? \"<div class='trending-bar'><div class='trending-fill' style='width:\"+post.hotScore+\"%;'></div></div>\"\n          : '';\n        var nameRow;\n        if(state.currentPage === 'historyposts'){\n          nameRow = \"<div class='post-meta'><div class='name'>\"+state.me.name+\"</div><div class='sub'>\"+subContent+\"</div></div>\";\n        }else{\n          nameRow = \"<div class='post-meta'><div class='name'>@\"+post.user+\"</div><div class='sub'>\"+subContent+\"</div></div>\";\n        }\n        var tagsHtml = (post.tags||[]).map(t=>\"<span class='tag'>\"+t+\"</span>\").join('');\n        return \"<div class='post'>\" +\n          \"<div class='post-header'>\"+headerExtra+\n            \"<div class='avatar'>\"+defaultAvatarSVG()+\"</div>\"+nameRow+\n          \"</div>\" +\n          \"<div class='post-content'>\"+post.content+\"</div>\" +\n          renderImage(post.image) +\n          \"<div class='post-tags'>\"+tagsHtml+\"</div>\" +\n          trendingBar +\n          \"<div class='post-actions' style='margin-top:9px;'>\" +\n            \"<div class='action \"+(post.liked?'liked':'')+\"' onclick=\\\"toggleLike(\"+post.id+\",this)\\\"><span class='icon'>\"+(post.liked?'❤️':'🤍')+\"</span><span class='count'>\"+post.likes+\"</span></div>\" +\n            \"<div class='action' onclick=\\\"toggleComments(\"+post.id+\")\\\"><span class='icon'>💬</span><span class='count'>\"+(post.displayComments||0)+\"</span></div>\" +\n            \"<div class='action' onclick=\\\"handleClick(this)\\\" data-toast='已分享'><span class='icon'>📎</span><span class='count'>分享</span></div>\" +\n          \"</div>\" +\n          renderComments(post) +\n        \"</div>\";\n      }).join('');\n    }\n  }\n  feed.innerHTML = html;\n}\n\nfunction toggleComments(postId){\n  var el = document.getElementById('comments-'+postId);\n  if(!el) return;\n  if(el.classList.contains('open')){ el.classList.remove('open'); return; }\n  el.classList.remove('open'); void el.offsetWidth; el.classList.add('open');\n}\n\nfunction toggleLike(postId, el){\n  var post = null;\n  for(var k in state.posts){\n    post = state.posts[k].find(p=>p.id===postId);\n    if(post) break;\n  }\n  if(!post) return;\n  if(post.liked){ post.likes--; state.totalLikes--; post.liked=false; el.classList.remove('liked'); el.querySelector('.icon').textContent='🤍'; }\n  else { post.likes++; state.totalLikes++; post.liked=true; el.classList.add('liked'); el.querySelector('.icon').textContent='❤️'; }\n  el.querySelector('.count').textContent = post.likes;\n}\n\nfunction switchTab(el){\n  document.querySelectorAll('.tab').forEach(t=>t.classList.remove('active'));\n  el.classList.add('active');\n  state.currentTab = el.dataset.tab;\n  renderPosts();\n  document.getElementById('feed').scrollTop = 0;\n}\n\nfunction switchPage(el){\n  document.querySelectorAll('.nav-item').forEach(n=>n.classList.remove('active'));\n  el.classList.add('active');\n  var targetPage = el.dataset.page;\n  state.currentPage = targetPage;\n  var tabsSlot = document.getElementById('tabs-slot');\n  if(state.currentPage === 'me'){\n    tabsSlot.style.display='none';\n  }else if(state.currentPage === 'home'){\n    tabsSlot.style.display='flex';\n    var firstTab = tabsSlot.querySelector('.tab');\n    document.querySelectorAll('.tab').forEach(t=>t.classList.remove('active'));\n    firstTab.classList.add('active');\n    state.currentTab='frost';\n  }\n  renderPosts();\n  document.getElementById('feed').scrollTop = 0;\n}\n\nfunction handleClick(el){ var msg = el.getAttribute('data-toast'); if(!msg) return; showToast(msg); }\nfunction showToast(msg){\n  var t = document.getElementById('toast');\n  t.textContent = msg;\n  t.classList.add('show');\n  setTimeout(()=>t.classList.remove('show'),2000);\n}\n\nfunction initSnow() {\n  var container = document.getElementById('snow-container');\n  if (!container) return;\n  container.innerHTML = '';\n  var count = 70;\n  for (var i = 0; i < count; i++) {\n    var flake = document.createElement('div');\n    flake.className = 'snowflake';\n    var size = Math.random() * 4 + 3;\n    flake.style.width = size + 'px';\n    flake.style.height = size + 'px';\n    flake.style.left = Math.random() * 100 + '%';\n    flake.style.opacity = (Math.random() * 0.2 + 0.2).toFixed(2);\n    var duration = Math.random() * 13 + 15;\n    flake.style.animationDuration = duration + 's';\n    flake.style.animationDelay = '-' + (Math.random() * 20) + 's';\n    var blurAmount = Math.random() * 1.5 + 0.5;\n    flake.style.filter = 'blur(' + blurAmount.toFixed(2) + 'px)';\n    container.appendChild(flake);\n  }\n}\n\ninitSnow();\nrenderPosts();\n</script>",
